<div class="feed-page static-page static-page--legal" data-translation-url="/ar/سياسة-الخصوصية/">

    <header class="feed-header">
        <h1 class="feed-title feed-title-topic">Privacy policy</h1>
        <p class="feed-lead">This page explains what data we collect when you use EduNews, why we collect it, and how you can control it.</p>
        <p class="static-updated">Last updated: 28 September 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="feature-reading-column">

        <section class="static-section">
            <div class="article-body-content">
                <h2>Data we collect</h2>
                <p>We may collect data when you subscribe to our newsletters or contact us, such as your name, email address and the content of your message. We also collect general usage data, such as the pages you visit and your device and browser type, using analytics tools and cookies.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="static-section">
            <div class="article-body-content">
                <h2>How we use your data</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>To send newsletters and reply to your messages.</li>
                    <li>To understand how the site is used and improve its content and performance.</li>
                    <li>To show advertising and measure how well it works.</li>
                    <li>To protect the site from abuse.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="static-section">
            <div class="article-body-content">
                <h2>Cookies</h2>
                <p>We use cookies and similar technologies to run the site, analyse its use and show advertising. You can delete or block cookies in your browser settings, though some parts of the site may not work as expected.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="static-section">
            <div class="article-body-content">
                <h2>Sharing data</h2>
                <p>We do not sell your personal data. We may share it with service providers who work on our behalf, such as email, analytics and advertising services, only as far as needed for them to do their job, or where the law requires it.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="static-section">
            <div class="article-body-content">
                <h2>How long we keep data</h2>
                <p>We keep your data for as long as needed for the purposes above or as the law requires, then delete it or remove anything that identifies you.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="static-section">
            <div class="article-body-content">
                <h2>Your rights</h2>
                <p>You can ask to see, correct or delete your data, and you can unsubscribe from newsletters at any time using the link in every email.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="static-section">
            <div class="article-body-content">
                <h2>Children</h2>
                <p>The site is aimed at a general audience and we do not knowingly collect personal data from children under 13.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="static-section">
            <div class="article-body-content">
                <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
                <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date of the latest update is shown at the top of the page.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="static-section">
            <div class="article-body-content">
                <h2>Contact us</h2>
                <p>For any privacy question, write to info@edunews.example.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

    </div>

